(4, 'Index Page', 'index', '&lt;h4 style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: myriad-pro, sans-serif; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.2; color: #6f6f6f; font-size: 16px; text-align: center; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); text-size-adjust: 100%; background-color: #f5f5f5;&quot;&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;icon-container&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;fab fa-youtube&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;icon-container&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;fab fa-telegram-plane&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;icon-container&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;fab fa-whatsapp&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; color: #6f6f6f; font-size: 12px; background-color: #f5f5f5; text-align: center; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Helvetica Neue\';&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; font-family: myriad-pro, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; color: #0000ff;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-right: -12px; margin-left: -12px; color: #212529; font-family: myriad-pro, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: #f5f5f5;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;col card mw-320  wow bounceIn&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; position: relative; width: 418.672px; min-height: 1px; padding: 1.5rem; flex-basis: 0px; flex-grow: 1; max-width: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; min-width: 320px; overflow-wrap: break-word; background: white; border: none; border-radius: 5px; animation-name: bounceIn; box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2) 0px 1px 2px 0px; margin: 12px; visibility: visible;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;text-center &quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; text-align: center !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fal fa-life-ring big-icon&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; display: inline-block; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; text-rendering: auto; line-height: 1; font-family: \'Font Awesome 5 Pro\'; font-size: 30px; opacity: 0.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;\r\n&lt;h2 class=&quot;m-2&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0.5rem !important; font-family: inherit; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.2; color: inherit; font-size: 1.5rem;&quot;&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;h2 class=&quot;m-2&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0.5rem !important; font-family: inherit; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.2; color: inherit; font-size: 1.5rem;&quot;&gt;24 Hours Support&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; color: #6f6f6f; font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Support 24 hours / 7 days-a-week. {Mista-unlock} operates a 24 hour/7 day-a-week email &amp;amp; remote support services that is staffed to handle any issue or question for the systems that we develop or support. Handled directly by our knowledgeable staff ensuring a quick and accurate response&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;col card mw-320  wow bounceIn&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; position: relative; width: 418.672px; min-height: 1px; padding: 1.5rem; flex-basis: 0px; flex-grow: 1; max-width: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; min-width: 320px; overflow-wrap: break-word; background: white; border: none; border-radius: 5px; animation-name: bounceIn; box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2) 0px 1px 2px 0px; margin: 12px; visibility: visible;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;rounded-20 text-center highlighted h-100&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; height: 166.797px; text-align: center !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fal fa-tags big-icon&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; display: inline-block; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; text-rendering: auto; line-height: 1; font-family: \'Font Awesome 5 Pro\'; font-size: 30px; opacity: 0.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;\r\n&lt;h2 class=&quot;m-2&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0.5rem !important; font-family: inherit; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.2; color: inherit; font-size: 1.5rem;&quot;&gt;Attractive Prices&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; color: #6f6f6f; font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;If you find a cheaper price from our competitors but you still want to use {Mista-unlock}&amp;nbsp;services, please feel free to contact us. all our advertised prices can be negotoated and we can always beat the competition&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;col  card mw-320  wow bounceIn&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; position: relative; width: 418.672px; min-height: 1px; padding: 1.5rem; flex-basis: 0px; flex-grow: 1; max-width: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; min-width: 320px; overflow-wrap: break-word; background: white; border: none; border-radius: 5px; animation-name: bounceIn; box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2) 0px 1px 2px 0px; margin: 12px; visibility: visible;&quot; col=&quot;&quot; card=&quot;&quot; mw-320=&quot;&quot; wow=&quot;&quot; bouncein=&quot;&quot;&gt;\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;rounded-20 text-center highlighted h-100&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; height: 166.797px; text-align: center !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fal fa-money-bill-wave big-icon&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; display: inline-block; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; text-rendering: auto; line-height: 1; font-family: \'Font Awesome 5 Pro\'; font-size: 30px; opacity: 0.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;\r\n&lt;h2 class=&quot;m-2&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0.5rem !important; font-family: inherit; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.2; color: inherit; font-size: 1.5rem;&quot;&gt;Money Back Guarantee&lt;/h2&gt;\r\n&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; color: #6f6f6f; font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;All of the services on our websites are covered by our 100% Money Back Guarantee. We provide such a guarantee to give honest customers the reassurance that the opening service they are ordering will be delivered in good faith.&lt;/p&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/div&gt;', 1, 1, '', 'English'),
(7, 'Index Page', 'index', '<h4 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: myriad-pro, sans-serif; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.2; color: #6f6f6f; font-size: 16px; text-align: center; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); text-size-adjust: 100%; background-color: #f5f5f5;\">\n    <span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #6f6f6f; font-size: 14pt;\">\n        <div class=\"title\">An Exciting Place to Grow Your Business!</div>\n        <iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/mPAXCuQS_1M\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen style=\"box-sizing: border-box; vertical-align: middle; border-style: none; max-width: 100%;\"></iframe>\n    </span>\n</h4>\n\n\n    <style>\n        .icon-container {\n            display: inline-flex;\n            justify-content: center;\n            align-items: center;\n            width: 100px;\n            height: 100px;\n            margin: 10px;\n            background-color: #fff;\n            box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);\n            font-size: 40px;\n            color: #000000;\n            border-radius: 10px;\n            transition: all 0.3s ease;\n        }\n        .title {\n            margin: 20px 0; /* Espacio arriba y abajo del título */\n            color: #4CAF50; /* Color del texto del título */\n            font-size: 24px; /* Tamaño del texto */\n            font-weight: bold; /* Negrita */\n            text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2); /* Sombra sutil */\n        }\n        .icon-container:hover {\n            box-shadow: 0 8px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);\n        }\n    </style>\n\n\n    <style>\n        body {\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n        }\n        \n        .telegram-button {\n            position: fixed;\n            bottom: 20px;\n            right: 20px;\n            z-index: 1000; /* Para asegurar que esté por encima del contenido */\n        }\n        \n        .telegram-button a {\n            display: block;\n            width: 50px; /* Ajusta el tamaño del icono según sea necesario */\n            height: 50px;\n            background-color: transparent;\n            border-radius: 50%; /* Para hacer el botón circular */\n            box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2); /* Sombra suave */\n            transition: transform 0.3s ease-in-out; /* Animación de transformación */\n        }\n        \n        .telegram-button a:hover {\n            transform: scale(1.1); /* Efecto de escala al pasar el ratón */\n        }\n        \n        .telegram-button img {\n            width: 100%; /* Ajusta el tamaño del icono al tamaño del botón */\n            height: auto;\n            border-radius: 50%; /* Para hacer el icono circular */\n        }\n    </style>\n\n    <!-- Botón flotante de Telegram -->\n    <div class=\"telegram-button\">\n        <a href=\"https://t.me/@i_ipwnedX\" target=\"_blank\">\n            <img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/83/Telegram_2019_Logo.svg/150px-Telegram_2019_Logo.svg.png\" alt=\"Telegram\">\n        </a>\n    </div>\n\n\n<h4 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: myriad-pro, sans-serif; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.2; color: #6f6f6f; font-size: 16px; background-color: #f5f5f5; text-align: center;\">\n    <span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder; font-size: 14pt; color: #0000ff;\">\n    <a href=\"https://t.me/@i_ipwnedX\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        <div class=\"icon-container\">\n            <i class=\"fab fa-youtube\"></i>\n        </div>\n    </a>\n    \n    <a href=\"https://t.me/@i_ipwnedX\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        <div class=\"icon-container\">\n            <i class=\"fab fa-telegram-plane\"></i>\n        </div>\n    </a>\n    \n    <a href=\"https://t.me/@i_ipwnedX\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        <div class=\"icon-container\">\n            <i class=\"fab fa-whatsapp\"></i>\n        </div>\n    </a>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; color: #6f6f6f; font-size: 12px; background-color: #f5f5f5; text-align: center; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Helvetica Neue\';\">\n    <span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: myriad-pro, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; color: #0000ff;\"></span>\n</p>\n<div class=\"row\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-right: -12px; margin-left: -12px; color: #212529; font-family: myriad-pro, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: #f5f5f5;\">\n    <div class=\"col card mw-320  wow bounceIn\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; position: relative; width: 418.672px; min-height: 1px; padding: 1.5rem; flex-basis: 0px; flex-grow: 1; max-width: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; min-width: 320px; overflow-wrap: break-word; background: white; border: none; border-radius: 5px; animation-name: bounceIn; box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2) 0px 1px 2px 0px; margin: 12px; visibility: visible;\">\n        <div class=\"text-center \" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; text-align: center !important;\">\n            <span class=\"fal fa-life-ring big-icon\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; display: inline-block; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; text-rendering: auto; line-height: 1; font-family: \'Font Awesome 5 Pro\'; font-size: 30px; opacity: 0.5;\"></span>\n            <h2 class=\"m-2\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0.5rem !important; font-family: inherit; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.2; color: inherit; font-size: 1.5rem;\"></h2>\n            <h2 class=\"m-2\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0.5rem !important; font-family: inherit; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.2; color: inherit; font-size: 1.5rem;\">24 Hours Support</h2>\n            <p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; color: #6f6f6f; font-size: 12px;\">Support 24 hours / 7 days-a-week. {Mista-unlock} operates a 24 hour/7 day-a-week email & remote support services that is staffed to handle any issue or question for the systems that we develop or support. Handled directly by our knowledgeable staff ensuring a quick and accurate response</p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col card mw-320  wow bounceIn\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; position: relative; width: 418.672px; min-height: 1px; padding: 1.5rem; flex-basis: 0px; flex-grow: 1; max-width: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; min-width: 320px; overflow-wrap: break-word; background: white; border: none; border-radius: 5px; animation-name: bounceIn; box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2) 0px 1px 2px 0px; margin: 12px; visibility: visible;\">\n        <div class=\"rounded-20 text-center highlighted h-100\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; height: 166.797px; text-align: center !important;\">\n            <span class=\"fal fa-tags big-icon\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; display: inline-block; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; text-rendering: auto; line-height: 1; font-family: \'Font Awesome 5 Pro\'; font-size: 30px; opacity: 0.5;\"></span>\n            <h2 class=\"m-2\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0.5rem !important; font-family: inherit; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.2; color: inherit; font-size: 1.5rem;\">Attractive Prices</h2>\n            <p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; color: #6f6f6f; font-size: 12px;\">If you find a cheaper price from our competitors but you still want to use {Mista-unlock}&nbsp;services, please feel free to contact us. all our advertised prices can be negotoated and we can always beat the competition</p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col  card mw-320  wow bounceIn\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; position: relative; width: 418.672px; min-height: 1px; padding: 1.5rem; flex-basis: 0px; flex-grow: 1; max\n    <div class=\"col card mw-320 wow bounceIn\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; position: relative; width: 418.672px; min-height: 1px; padding: 1.5rem; flex-basis: 0px; flex-grow: 1; max-width: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; min-width: 320px; overflow-wrap: break-word; background: white; border: none; border-radius: 5px; animation-name: bounceIn; box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2) 0px 1px 2px 0px; margin: 12px; visibility: visible;\">\n        <div class=\"rounded-20 text-center highlighted h-100\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; height: 166.797px; text-align: center !important;\">\n            <span class=\"fal fa-money-bill-wave big-icon\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; display: inline-block; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; text-rendering: auto; line-height: 1; font-family: \'Font Awesome 5 Pro\'; font-size: 30px; opacity: 0.5;\"></span>\n            <h2 class=\"m-2\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0.5rem !important; font-family: inherit; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.2; color: inherit; font-size: 1.5rem;\">Money Back Guarantee</h2>\n            <p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; color: #6f6f6f; font-size: 12px;\">All of the services on our websites are covered by our 100% Money Back Guarantee. We provide such a guarantee to give honest customers the reassurance that the opening service they are ordering will be delivered in good faith.</p>\n        </div>\n    </div>', 1, 1, '', 'Spanish'),
